      "claim": "Fairtrade International’s certification scheme defines eligible product categories and explicitly excludes electronic devices.",
      "evidence": "Fairtrade International’s 2023‑2024 ‘Eligible Product Categories’ document lists only agricultural and some textile products and states that electronics are outside the scope of the Fairtrade Standard.",
