      "answer": "Yes",
      "reason_rejected": "The alternative relies on a broader, informal use of the term “fair trade” (e.g., ethical sourcing, conflict‑free minerals). However, the question asks whether a laptop can be bought that carries the official Fairtrade certification, which applies only to the product categories listed by Fairtrade International and does not include electronics."
